# Build output
engine/build/
driver/build/
**/build/
*.obj
*.exe
*.lib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp

# WDK / MSBuild driver build outputs (intermediates + signed package land in x64/ dirs)
**/x64/
**/arm64/
**/ARM64/
**/Win32/
*.sys
*.cat

# All third-party / fetched / external content is kept out of the repo:
#   third_party/ffmpeg     - FFmpeg dev libs (re-fetch: scripts/fetch-ffmpeg.ps1)
#   third_party/reference  - reference clones (SoundPusher, Windows-driver-samples, ...)
#   third_party/vbcable    - VB-Audio VB-CABLE installer (proprietary; download separately)
# (use /* so specific entries below can be re-included)
third_party/*
# ...except the vendored doctest single-header (MIT) — needed to build the unit tests.
!third_party/doctest/
!third_party/doctest/doctest.h

# Test artifacts
engine/test/*.wav
engine/test/*.spdif
engine/test/*.ac3

# Release staging / artifacts
dist/
installer/Output/
*.zip

# Editor/OS
.vs/
*.user
.DS_Store

# Additional local build directory
engine/build-control-center-test/

# Local source backups
*.bak-*
